    "name_cap": 1000000000,
    "vol_target": 0.15,
    "hedge_window": 30
  }
}
```

- `sector_cap`: Represents the maximum sector exposure limit. - `name_cap`: Indicates the maximum exposure per name (or security). - `vol_target`: The target volatility (e.g., 15%). - `hedge_window`: The time frame (in days) for applying hedging strategies.
